sVGenera Games collects information as described below.
p19
I1
sVWith your permission, we will also collect your exact location so that we are able to match you with other players in your area.
p20
I1
sVWe may use this information to monitor, develop, and analyze your use of the Service.
p21
I1
sVWe may collect your email address when you contact our customer service and we may use that email address to contact you about your gaming experience with Genera Games and notify you about company news and promotions.
